  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multimodal multiprofile models with scvi_n200 RNA and imagenet_vit_l image encoders (config_001) achieve the highest accuracy. However, config_015 (resnet50 image encoder) has a higher F1, suggesting encoder choice matters. This experiment tests scgpt RNA + resnet50 image encoders (untested combination) with transformer aggregation and weighted fusion (similar to config_001), isolating the impact of encoder choices while maintaining proven aggregation/fusion strategies. It balances exploration of key design choices with exploitation of prior success."
